      "normalizedSource": "Doing so also registers the clip view for the notifications [`frameDidChangeNotification`](nsview/framedidchangenotification.md) and [`boundsDidChangeNotification`](nsview/boundsdidchangenotification.md), adjusts the key view loop to include the new document view, and updates a parent [`NSScrollView`](nsscrollview.md) display if needed using [`reflectScrolledClipView(_:)`](nsscrollview/reflectscrolledclipview(_:).md).",
